<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-LAST QUOTES - Australian Eurobond benchmarks.</title>
<headline>RTRS-LAST QUOTES - Australian Eurobond benchmarks.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
